12
00:00:25,557 --> 00:00:27,727
(Bernadette:)Couldn't hurt.

13
00:00:27,726 --> 00:00:28,626
LEONARD:
Mm, I don't know.

14
00:00:28,627 --> 00:00:30,427
(Leonard:)Who here has ever been hurt

15
00:00:30,429 --> 00:00:31,999
(Leonard:)because they were
the teacher's pet?

16
00:00:36,368 --> 00:00:38,668
(Sheldon:)It was like the rest of
the class wanted Ms. McDonald

17
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,540
(Sheldon:)to forget the quiz.

18
